---
import ArrowIcon from "../components/ArrowIcon.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { studyRegistry } from "../data/research";
---

<BaseLayout title="Planned checks" canonicalPath="/research" description="What ai-fanout.com plans to check, what has actually been done, and what remains unproven.">
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1>What we plan to check</h1>
    <div class="page-head-copy">
      <p>This page separates planned checks from work that has actually been completed. Nothing listed here is a result yet.</p>
      <p class="meta-line">Current state · one check planned · not started</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section-pad section-rule" aria-labelledby="studies-title">
    <span class="section-number">01</span>
    <h2 id="studies-title" class="section-title">Planned checks</h2>
    <p class="section-lede">A plan explains what we intend to do. It is not proof and it is not a result.</p>
    <ol class="study-list ruled-list">
      {studyRegistry.map((study) => (
        <li>
          <article>
            <div class="study-heading"><span>{study.id}</span><h3>{study.title}</h3><strong>{study.state}</strong></div>
            <p>{study.job}</p>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Collection</dt><dd>{study.collection}</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Publication</dt><dd>{study.publication}</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Owner</dt><dd>{study.owner}</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Blocking gate</dt><dd>{study.gate}</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </article>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="research-contract section-pad section-rule" aria-labelledby="contract-title">
    <div><span class="section-number">02</span><h2 id="contract-title" class="section-title">Rules for every check</h2></div>
    <ol>
      <li><span>Plan</span><p>Freeze the question set, public surface, locale, route, timing, exclusions and cost ceiling.</p></li>
      <li><span>Observe</span><p>Record public outputs and visible sources with timestamps and missing-data reasons.</p></li>
      <li><span>Compare</span><p>Break or annotate the series when a prompt, interface, model or policy change invalidates comparability.</p></li>
      <li><span>Publish</span><p>Release only rights-safe evidence with denominators, method, limitations and corrections.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad next-band">
    <p>The next step is to write down the exact test before collecting anything.</p>
    <a class="text-action" href="/methodology">See how the free tool works <ArrowIcon /></a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .study-list { margin-top: 3rem; }
  .study-list article { padding-block: 2rem; }
  .study-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 5rem minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 1rem; align-items: baseline; }
  .study-heading > span { color: var(--signal); font: 0.8rem/1 var(--font-mono); }
  .study-heading h3 { margin: 0; font: 400 clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3.4rem)/1 var(--font-display); }
  .study-heading strong { color: var(--signal); font: 0.72rem/1 var(--font-mono); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .study-list article > p { max-width: 60ch; margin: 1.5rem 0 0 6rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }
  .study-list dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); margin: 2rem 0 0 6rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--fine-rule); }
  .study-list dl > div { padding: 1rem 1rem 0 0; }
  .study-list dt { color: var(--muted); font: 0.68rem/1.3 var(--font-mono); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .study-list dd { margin: 0.45rem 0 0; font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .research-contract { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.7fr 1.3fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 8rem); }
  .research-contract ol { margin: 0; padding: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); list-style: none; }
  .research-contract li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 8rem 1fr; gap: 1rem; padding-block: 1.2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--fine-rule); }
  .research-contract li span { color: var(--signal); font: 0.76rem/1.5 var(--font-mono); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .research-contract li p { margin: 0; line-height: 1.55; }
  .next-band { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; }
  .next-band p { max-width: 44rem; margin: 0; font: 400 clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 3.5rem)/1.05 var(--font-display); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .study-heading { grid-template-columns: 4rem 1fr; }
    .study-heading strong { grid-column: 2; }
    .study-list article > p, .study-list dl { margin-left: 0; }
    .study-list dl { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .research-contract { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .research-contract li { grid-template-columns: 6.5rem 1fr; }
    .next-band { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
  }
</style>
